" ▲ pSIONIUM test │ local · not signed in │ pq-hybrid-768 │ offline                                                                                                                               portal "
"╭────────────────────╮╭ Help ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮"
"│  1 Home            ││ New here? Press t for a one-minute tutorial.                                                                                                                                   │"
"│  2 Encrypt         ││                                                                                                                                                                                │"
"│  3 Decrypt         ││ Keys everywhere                                                                                                                                                                │"
"│  4 Keys            ││   Ctrl+K  /   command palette: type to find any action                                                                                                                         │"
"│  5 Scan            ││   :           the pSIONIUM> prompt (any psion command)                                                                                                                         │"
"│  6 Console         ││   1-8         jump to a screen                                                                                                                                                 │"
"│  7 Settings        ││   Tab ↑ ↓     move between fields and rows                                                                                                                                     │"
"│› 8 Help            ││   Esc         back to the screen list                                                                                                                                          │"
"│                    ││   F1  ?       this help                                                                                                                                                        │"
"│ Send · Inbox       ││   Ctrl+Q      quit                                                                                                                                                             │"
"│ need accounts      ││                                                                                                                                                                                │"
"│                    ││ On the Home screen                                                                                                                                                             │"
"│                    ││   e d q k t   encrypt, decrypt, scan, keys, tutorial                                                                                                                           │"
"│                    ││                                                                                                                                                                                │"
"│                    ││ What works today                                                                                                                                                               │"
"│                    ││   Everything here runs on this computer: identities, encryption, signatures, scans.                                                                                            │"
"│                    ││   Accounts, sending files to people and the inbox are designed but not built yet.                                                                                              │"
"│                    ││                                                                                                                                                                                │"
"│                    ││ Scripting                                                                                                                                                                      │"
"│                    ││   Every action shows its psion command in the bottom bar. psion <command> --help explains each one.                                                                            │"
"│                    ││   psion --plain gives a line-by-line pSIONIUM> prompt; NO_COLOR turns colours off.                                                                                             │"
"│                    ││                                                                                                                                                                                │"
